    description: Some("Five head-to-head games for two or four players, split across three tape loads: race a buggy while rivals lob bricks at it, drag a rope across the centre line by hammering the button, sling a wizard\'s fireballs at chickens and jesters, shift packages between conveyor belts against the clock, and drive a handcar through the desert."),
